1. LFM3-1.7B-Base (Liquid AI, Inc.), LFM Open License v1.0
   The model weights in model/ are LoRA adapters and a classification head trained on top of
   LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B-Base (revision 545fc8f4c7b5fa9f405105274cd29c4f8f44b526). The base model is not redistributed;
   it is downloaded from Hugging Face when the model is loaded. The full text of the LFM Open License v1.0 is in
